9
00:00:44.204 --> 00:00:48.137
Face wash. Say it with me. Face wash!

10
00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:55.637
Clean clothes. Say it with me. Clean clothes!

11
00:00:59.171 --> 00:01:02.738
Hair. Say it with me. Hair!

12
00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:09.996
