13
00:01:13.519 --> 00:01:22.899
During puberty, the body makes more sweat and oil. A daily shower, clean clothes, and deodorant help. Washing my face gently can help with acne.

14
00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.260
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:30.867
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:32.067
Shower!

17
00:01:33.014 --> 00:01:38.163
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.213 --> 00:01:39.363
Hair!

19
00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:46.723
Did you know? Squeezing pimples can spread germs and leave scars — gentle washing is better!

20
00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.633
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:57.437
Think and answer. What new hygiene habits might you need during puberty?

22
